	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Backpack",
	"Description": "Backpacks (M11 G6, combat-loadout-mods.md §10): Helldivers-style backpacks attached on top of the kit implant through the standard connector. The backpack asset is data (look, abilities with command bindings, passives, effects); the player's backpack is a loadout extension kept through a kit swap. Its verbs are abilities granted by the loadout compile; its memory (charges per move slot) and dome are combat sync state run by the GSTNBackpackNP tick extension (M11 L7b).",
